<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Jan trade deficit 95.5 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Jan trade deficit 95.5 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia had a trade deficit of 95.5 million ringgit in January against a surplus of 871 million in December, the Statistics Department said on Friday.  </p>
<p>		     MALAYSIA TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>		     (in billions of ringgit)</p>
<p>		     January 1997	 January 1996</p>
<p>Trade balance	 -0.1		   -1.1</p>
<p>Exports		 16.8		   16.2</p>
<p>Imports		 16.9		   17.3</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
